Spring Boot 4.1.x\
Spring Framework 7.x\
Spring Security 7.x\
Gradle\
PostgreSQL 18\
Flyway\
Spring Data JPA / Hibernate\
Bean Validation\
Spring Web MVC\
Actuator\
Jackson\
