\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 9. MONEY AND ACCOUNTING RULES\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Money calculations must be deterministic.\
Never perform financial calculations using Java double.\
Never silently round.\
Define rounding policies explicitly.\
For example:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 monetary storage precision\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 calculation precision\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 display precision\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 distribution rounding\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 percentage rounding\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Document these rules.\
Every financial transaction must be traceable.\
Never mutate historical financial transactions simply because a later calculation changes.\
Prefer immutable transaction records.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 10. INVESTMENT MODEL\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 An investment should contain at minimum:\
id\
userId\
investmentOpportunityId\
amount\
currency\
status\
createdAt\
updatedAt\
investmentDate\
legalInterestPercentage where applicable\
and appropriate references to the underlying legal structure.\
Do not calculate historical ownership purely from current property data.\
Historical investment state must remain reproducible.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 11. TRANSACTION MODEL\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Treat financial operations as important domain events.\
Examples:\
INVESTMENT_CREATED\
PAYMENT_PENDING\
PAYMENT_COMPLETED\
PAYMENT_FAILED\
INVESTMENT_CONFIRMED\
DISTRIBUTION_CREATED\
DISTRIBUTION_ALLOCATED\
DISTRIBUTION_PAID\
REFUND_CREATED\
REFUND_COMPLETED\
Do not simply update:\
balance = balance + amount\
without creating an auditable record.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 12. IDEMPOTENCY\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 All operations involving money or investment creation must be idempotent.\
Examples:\
POST /api/v1/investments\
POST /api/v1/payments\
POST /api/v1/distributions\
must support an idempotency mechanism where appropriate.\
A repeated request must not create duplicate investments or duplicate financial transactions.\
Use an idempotency key and database uniqueness constraint.\
Do not rely only on frontend protection.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 13. AUTHENTICATION\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Authentication must be production-oriented.\
Use Spring Security.\
Use short-lived access tokens.\
Use secure refresh-token handling.\
Do NOT store sensitive authentication secrets in localStorage.\
Prefer secure HttpOnly cookies for refresh-token/session mechanisms where the architecture supports them.\
Access tokens should be handled carefully and never exposed unnecessarily.\
Password storage must use a modern adaptive password hashing algorithm supported by Spring Security.\
Never store plaintext passwords.\
Never log:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 passwords\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 access tokens\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 refresh tokens\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 payment secrets\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 identity documents\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 sensitive personal information\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 14. JWT\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 If JWT is used, implement it properly.\
Validate:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
