\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://api.md/"}}{\fldrslt \cf4 \ul \ulc4 \strokec4 API.md}} or generated OpenAPI\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
